[opheld1,misc_ghrimbook]
    ~mesbox("Managing Thine Kingdom for Noobes | by Advisor Ghrim. Second Edition.");

[opheld1,fenk_letter]
    ~mesbox("Brother Rologarric, | I confess it. I sent them into the forest as gifts for the creatures  -  even the girl  -  and told myself the castle would be spared. | I believe Fenkenstrain struck his own bargain with them, and that the price of it was my castle. | Every gift only makes them stronger, and hungrier. | I have sent them all to their doom, and now I fear my own. | Rologarth, 15th Lord of the North Coast");

[opheld1,roving_cadarn_book]
    ~mesbox("The Cadarn Clan | One of the eight elven clans that came to Gielinor with Seren in the First Age. Theirs was ever the role of protector.");

[opheld1,ahoy_map_complete]
    ~mesbox("A map of Dragontooth Island. A red cross marks a spot on the north-western peninsula, and beside it a column of figures: | 6 - South | 8 - East | 2 - North | 4 - East | 22 - South");

[opheld1,roving_crystal_book]
    ~mesbox("Chapter 1: The Crystal Seed | All elven crystal begins as a seed, and every seed came from Tarddiad. The seeds are not dead things: they wake, and they take the measure of whoever first uses them.");

[opheld1,favour_animate_rock]
    ~mesbox("A spell for the animation of stone, and for the waking of those the stone has taken. | Speak it clearly, and mind what you point it at. | 'Um nahi listic durooo-rah!'");

[opheld1,favour_weather_report]
    ~mesbox("Generally quite changeable weather, perhaps starting quite sunny with some chances of rain, snow or hail, and a large possibility of a thunderstorm or clear skies.");

[opheld1,dwarf_rock_book]
    ~mesbox("Handle these pages gently. They are older than the halls you are standing in.");

[opheld1,feud_fib_hint]
    mes("The piece of paper has the word 'Fibonacci' scrawled on it.");

[opheld1,feud_nos_note]
    ~mesbox("These numbers contained within, | A sequence age old begin, | Have a look, | Where do they fit in? | 1,1,2,3,5....");

[opheld1,four_diamonds_translation_primer]
    ~mesbox("Terry Balando's rough working, taken from the etchings: | 'the gods (argued/decided) amongst themselves that the (fortress/home) would be the (selected/chosen) place that would (imprison/conceal) the (wealth/power)' | '...and four (diamonds/jewels) were left behind as the (key/opening)...' | Note: the bracketed words are alternatives. The old tongue is uncertain and I would not stake a reputation on any single reading.");

[opheld1,ics_little_bookofembalming]
    ~mesbox("The Little Book of Embalming, by Bod E. Wrapper | Preserve the body and the spirit may sustain itself in the afterlife. Of ceremony I say little; this is a manual of craft.");

[opheld1,barrows_book_history]
    ~mesbox("The Legend of the Brothers | Set down while the God Wars still burned.");

[opheld1,zogre_necromantic_page]
    ~mesbox("Half a page, torn raggedly down the middle. | What can still be read speaks of a curse laid upon this place, to raise the dead 'for all time'. | A guild emblem is stamped in the corner.");

[opheld1,zogre_portrait_book]
    ~mesbox("On the Taking of Likenesses | To capture a subject faithfully, use a piece of papyrus upon them and set to work with charcoal. | Stand where you can see the face plainly, and do not hurry the work.");

[opheld1,zogre_hambook]
    ~mesbox("Humans Against Monsters | The king does not do enough. Every year more of our people are taken by things that should not walk. | If the crown will not protect us, then we shall protect ourselves. | Join H.A.M.");

[opheld1,zogre_necrobook]
    ~mesbox("The book is written in a very strange language, and marked with symbols you cannot begin to read. | It has a very dark and evil feeling to it. | One of the pages has been torn, and half of it is missing.");

[opheld1,lost_tribe_book]
    ~mesbox("On the Ancient Goblin Tribes | The goblins were made by a war-god for war, and in the elder days they were better ordered  -  and far better armed  -  than they are now.");

[opheld1,dwarf_meeting_notes1]
