[opheld1,forget_gardener_letter]
    ~mesbox("Dear Elstan, | I have followed your papers on cross-pollinating the B-branch specialist flowers with great enthusiasm. Your talk at the Annual Asgarnia Gardening Conference was inspirational, whatever the other attendants thought  -  they must not share our vision. | My own experiments have produced triple herbicide resistance in cabbages. Of no practical use whatever, but the theoretical implications are astounding! | Perhaps the next conference might be hosted in Keldagrim? |");

[opheld1,garden_list]
    ~mesbox("Items I need to get for King Roald's garden: | 4 delphinium seeds, 3 yellow orchid seeds, 3 pink orchid seeds | 4 snowdrop seeds, 4 vine seeds, 1 white tree shoot | 3 red rose seeds, 3 pink rose seeds, 3 white rose seeds | Ask Elstan near Falador, Lyra near Port Phasmatys, Kragen near Ardougne and Bernald in Burthorpe.");

