[opheld1,burgh_efaritay_info_scroll]
    ~mesbox("My dearest Lantania, | I know not what these dark hours bring, but I will come for thee as soon as I am able. Make ready, and bring only what you need. | With Saradomin's blessings we shall make our way out of Hallowvale and head westwards over the Salve. | I pray that Saradomin supports Queen Efaritay in her hour of need, and I cry at the plight of poor Ascertes and their children. | Yours, most faithfully, | Sialathin");

